   "boundElements": null,
   "text": "Loop guard: both Lambdas ignore events whose actor is their own role (remediation-role).\nIAM role is least-privilege: logs, PutBucketPublicAccessBlock on ia2-test-bucket-*, sns:Publish on one topic, cloudtrail:StartLogging on one trail.",
